### Admin: profile get
GET http://localhost:5000/api/admin/profile
Origin: http://localhost:5173

### Admin: profile update
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/admin/profile
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: http://localhost:5173

{
  "fullName": "Yakshit Koshiya",
  "siteName": "Yakshit Portfolio",
  "typingTitles": ["Full Stack MERN Developer", "React Developer"],
  "about": "Portfolio profile details updated.",
  "location": "Surat, Gujarat",
  "showPhone": false,
  "accentColor": "#2f7bff"
}

### Admin: profile avatar upload
POST http://localhost:5000/api/admin/profile/avatar
Origin: http://localhost:5173
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="avatar.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./sample-avatar.png
------WebKitFormBoundary--

### Admin: profile resume upload
POST http://localhost:5000/api/admin/profile/resume
Origin: http://localhost:5173
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="resume"; filename="resume.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./sample-resume.pdf
------WebKitFormBoundary--

### Admin: delete profile resume
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/admin/profile/resume
Origin: http://localhost:5173

### Admin: list projects
GET http://localhost:5000/api/admin/projects
Origin: http://localhost:5173

### Admin: create project
POST http://localhost:5000/api/admin/projects
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: http://localhost:5173

{
  "title": "Portfolio Website",
  "shortDescription": "A modern portfolio for Yakshit.",
  "description": "Built using React and Node.",
  "techStack": ["React", "Node.js", "MongoDB"],
  "liveUrl": "https://example.com",
  "githubUrl": "https://github.com/example",
  "featured": true,
  "visible": true,
  "order": 1
}

### Admin: update project
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/admin/projects/64f8c70f7f37d5952dca1234
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: http://localhost:5173

{
  "title": "Updated Portfolio Website",
  "featured": true,
  "visible": true,
  "order": 2
}

### Admin: upload project images
POST http://localhost:5000/api/admin/projects/64f8c70f7f37d5952dca1234/images
Origin: http://localhost:5173
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="images"; filename="project-1.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./sample-project-image.png
------WebKitFormBoundary--

