GET http://localhost:5000/api/health

### Public: contact inquiry (set startedAt at least 3 seconds before sending)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/public/contact
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: http://localhost:5173

{
  "name": "Portfolio visitor",
  "email": "visitor@example.com",
  "subject": "Project inquiry",
  "message": "I would like to discuss a portfolio project.",
  "website": "",
  "startedAt": 1000
}

### Public: contact validation errors
POST http://localhost:5000/api/public/contact
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: http://localhost:5173

{
  "name": "A",
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "message": "Short"
}

### Public: reject unknown contact fields
POST http://localhost:5000/api/public/contact
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: http://localhost:5173

{
  "name": "Portfolio visitor",
  "email": "visitor@example.com",
  "message": "This message passes the minimum length.",
  "extra": true
}

### Public: contact honeypot (returns success without saving)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/public/contact
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: http://localhost:5173

{
  "name": "Spam bot",
  "email": "bot@example.com",
  "message": "This message is long enough for validation.",
  "website": "filled-by-a-bot",
  "startedAt": 1000
}

### Public: contact rate limit (send this request 6 times quickly; the 6th gets 429)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/public/contact
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: http://localhost:5173

{
  "name": "Rate limit test",
  "email": "rate-test@example.com",
  "message": "This request is for verifying contact rate limits.",
  "website": "",
  "startedAt": 1000
}

### Admin: retry failed inquiry email
POST http://localhost:5000/api/admin/inquiries/64f8c70f7f37d5952dca8888/resend-email
Origin: http://localhost:5173

### Admin: list inquiries with failed notification emails
GET http://localhost:5000/api/admin/inquiries?page=1&limit=10&emailFailed=true
Origin: http://localhost:5173
